  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Label</name>
    <text>

      Autorisation of the RF generator for Beam or for PLasma only.

   PS  :  Power Supply

   HV : High Voltage (FUG 120kV)
   COIL01,COIL02 : Coils around the plasma chamber (Hazemeyer)
   IE : Intermediate Electrode ( FUG )
   R : Repeller
   SOL01,SOL02 : Solenoids on the LEBT  (Hazemeyer)
   RC : Repeller on the injection cone
   STV01,STH01,STV02,STH02 : Steerers (Hazemeyer)


  FC : Faraday cup
  GV : Gate Valve 
  CHOPPER : Chopper inserted in th LEBT

  FlowStat : Status of the water flow meter
  DefStat   : Status of the default of the power supply





</text>
    <x>48</x>
    <y>78</y>
    <width>835</width>
    <height>500</height>
    <font>
      <font family="Sans" style="REGULAR" size="11.881188118811881">
      </font>
    </font>
    <actions>
    </actions>
    <border_color>
      <color red="0" green="128" blue="255">
      </color>
    </border_color>
  </widget>
</display>
